Like the whole point of this,

00:17:43.180 --> 00:17:45.370
and the difference between a problem and opportunity is,

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:49.015
if you go and talk to a bunch of people in hear problem back from them,

00:17:49.015 --> 00:17:52.270
it is possible to solve that problem and still not build

00:17:52.270 --> 00:17:54.670
a successful product because you're not able to

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:57.655
capture any of the value for the problem that you generate.

00:17:57.655 --> 00:18:00.010
So today we're not focused on business models,

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:02.080
we're not focused on pricing and packaging,

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:05.230
we at least wanna flag up front that you must be thoughtful,

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:07.435
not just about solving customer problems,

00:18:07.435 --> 00:18:11.200
you have to believe there is someway for you and your company to capture value.

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:14.560
And I would say that a lot of times at a larger company,

00:18:14.560 --> 00:18:20.140
it's almost easier to lean on the side of fit for company as opposed to good for user.

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:21.460
