00:18:30.340 --> 00:18:32.140
We are to then to say, what is good for company?

00:18:32.140 --> 00:18:34.120
what's the opportunity that Anand was talking about?

00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:36.370
To get to this happy, middle ground,

00:18:36.370 --> 00:18:38.905
kind of the intersection in the same diagram.

00:18:38.905 --> 00:18:45.880
Yep. So again, let's talk about what it means to be the, uh, for, excuse me.

00:18:45.880 --> 00:18:49.210
What does it mean to be good for the user, it's pretty simple.

00:18:49.210 --> 00:18:50.440
I mean, these people love their thing.

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:54.745
Um, favorite examples of this are, er,

00:18:54.745 --> 00:18:56.785
every time Nintendo launches a new product,

00:18:56.785 --> 00:18:58.270
